utt joint"},{"t":74.8,"txt":"so you could use it there i'm looking"},{"t":76.5,"txt":"over at my clamp rack that i just built"},{"t":79,"txt":"at the base"},{"t":80.2,"txt":"and their butt joints all around that"},{"t":83.1,"txt":"rectangular base so that'll be the start"},{"t":85.5,"txt":"of building our practice piece here is"},{"t":88.1,"txt":"to put two coupons together"},{"t":91,"txt":"in a butt joint now the coupons i'm"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"using are 1 8 of an inch thick"},{"t":96.6,"txt":"and 2 inches wide by 4 inches long now"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"something else interesting about a butt"},{"t":100.9,"txt":"joint like this the type of weld is"},{"t":103.3,"txt":"actually a different name than the type"},{"t":105.2,"txt":"of joint so even though this is a butt"},{"t":107.7,"txt":"joint here the weld that we're putting"},{"t":109.8,"txt":"in is a groove weld because it fits down"},{"t":113.4,"txt":"in a groove now there are a whole ton of"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"different types of groove welds and they"},{"t":117,"txt":"get complicated when you get into"},{"t":118.6,"txt":"welding codes and things like that but"},{"t":121,"txt":"this one here is called a square groove"},{"t":123.1,"txt":"weld because they come together and the"},{"t":126.6,"txt":"edges fit together just like a square up"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"against one another the next joint that"},{"t":130.9,"txt":"you're likely to encounter is called a"},{"t":132.8,"txt":"lap joint that's where you have two"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"pieces of material overlapping one"},{"t":138.6,"txt":"another like this"},{"t":140.3,"txt":"and down in this corner here you'll put"},{"t":143.9,"txt":"in what's called a phillip weld now a"},{"t":146.1,"txt":"fillet weld is any time that you're"},{"t":148.1,"txt":"welding into a corner i'll continue"},{"t":151,"txt":"building on my piece here by putting one"},{"t":154.2,"txt":"of the coupons overlapping one of the"},{"t":156.2,"txt":"others from the butt joint"},{"t":158.3,"txt":"into this lap 