 that this fillet weld was not done"},{"t":241,"txt":"in one run this is something kind of"},{"t":242.5,"txt":"interesting i did this in several"},{"t":245.3,"txt":"segments and i started a few inches up"},{"t":248.1,"txt":"from the end and welded all the way up"},{"t":250.5,"txt":"to the end and then moved forward"},{"t":252.8,"txt":"welded back and in this back stepping"},{"t":255.8,"txt":"technique i was able to avoid distortion"},{"t":258.9,"txt":"so that's a good tip if you ever have to"},{"t":261.1,"txt":"weld something really long now to add"},{"t":263,"txt":"the t-joint onto the practice piece i"},{"t":265.3,"txt":"just need to tack it on but i need to be"},{"t":267.3,"txt":"careful where i do it because if i were"},{"t":269.3,"txt":"to put it right up here in front of the"},{"t":271.1,"txt":"lap joint it's going to be pretty hard"},{"t":272.9,"txt":"to get in there to that lap joint now if"},{"t":274.5,"txt":"you wanted to practice you know having"},{"t":277.1,"txt":"restricted access or something like that"},{"t":279.7,"txt":"you couldn't do that"},{"t":281.1,"txt":"but i think for"},{"t":282.7,"txt":"those who are just learning it's better"},{"t":284.2,"txt":"to put it over on the opposite side so"},{"t":287.3,"txt":"that you have access to the lap joint"},{"t":289.8,"txt":"here"},{"t":290.8,"txt":"as well as both sides of this t-joint"},{"t":293.8,"txt":"and that gives you two more joints to"},{"t":295.6,"txt":"practice as it sits right now you have"},{"t":297.9,"txt":"four pieces of material and that gives"},{"t":300.7,"txt":"you the chance to practice a butt joint"},{"t":304,"txt":"a lap joint and a t-joint and that in"},{"t":307.3,"txt":"and of itself is going to give you"},{"t":308.7,"txt":"pretty good practice in fact i started"},{"t":310.6,"txt":"doing this years ago i volunteered as a"},{"t":313.4,"txt":"merit badge counselor for the boy scouts"},{"t":316,"txt":"for their welding merit badge and one of"},{"t":318,"txt":"the requirements for that i